!! answers ~ lifted · landed-nothing · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`lifted` params=`exit/0 ~ the row lifted under the face's root; the door's answer prints as JSON`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`landed-nothing` params=`exit/0 ~ a head already carries the row; nothing landed`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ the door refused by name; the line carries its reason`>>
```

